1
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:21,320
Congratulations to all surviving
passengers on clearing the level.

2
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:23,400
First stop, the Nether Mortuary.

3
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:25,560
Instance difficulty has increased.

4
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:29,120
All remaining points will be automatically
converted into initial advantages.

5
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:30,120
Points requirement met.

6
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:33,980
Exclusive skill "Forensic Investigation"
upgraded successfully.

7
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:35,960
Looks like brains really do beat brawn

8
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:37,680
in this hellhole.

9
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:40,520
Judging by the mess outside,

10
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:42,720
the next level will be even tougher.

11
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:46,400
How about we keep teaming up?

12
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:48,000
You find the clues,

13
00:00:48,080 --> 00:00:49,480
and I'll do the fighting.

14
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:50,600
Teaming up is fine,

15
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:52,120
but let me be clear.

16
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:53,760
Put away your sympathy.

17
00:00:53,760 --> 00:00:54,840
In this hellhole,

18
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:56,650
the bleeding hearts die first.

19
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:58,000
Don't worry.

20
00:00:58,240 --> 00:00:59,570
My life is valuable too.

21
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:05,000
We're here.

22
00:01:07,880 --> 00:01:09,640
Welcome to the Ghost Empress's
Deep Palace.

23
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:11,039
Main quest for this stop:

24
00:01:11,160 --> 00:01:13,400
At midnight, during the Ancestral
Sacrifice Ceremony,

25
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:14,960
assassinate the pinnacle of power

26
00:01:14,960 --> 00:01:17,200
to appease the resentment
of the deep palace

27
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:18,530
and break the deadlock.

28
00:01:22,360 --> 00:01:25,039
The palace? Assassinate the pinnacle
of power?

29
00:01:25,160 --> 00:01:27,289
Are they asking us to kill the emperor?

30
00:01:45,039 --> 00:01:47,570
Welcoming the Head of the
Imperial Hospital.

31
00:01:48,440 --> 00:01:49,680
Lower officials, step back three paces.

32
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:51,039
Do not look directly at the
Head Physician.

33
00:01:51,039 --> 00:01:53,000
Instance environment change detected.

34
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,720
Player weapons have been localized.

35
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:02,600
He's with me.

36
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:03,560
The knife.

37
00:02:04,080 --> 00:02:04,800
Put it away.

38
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:13,610
Why do you guys get to dress so well?

39
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,440
Why am I wearing a sack?

40
00:02:15,640 --> 00:02:17,640
This stupid game is targeting me.

41
00:02:22,760 --> 00:02:25,120
You mannerless lowly eunuch!

42
00:02:25,480 --> 00:02:27,560
The cut from the castration room
still hurts, doesn't it?

43
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:31,520
Imperial Physician Xiao is the
Empress Dowager's favorite.

44
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:32,680
If you offend him,

45
00:02:33,079 --> 00:02:35,520
how many layers of skin do you
have to be flayed?

46
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:37,600
Get over here and kowtow right now!

47
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:39,160
I-I won't kowtow.

48
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:41,090
Why the hell should I kowtow to him?

49
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:44,280
I'll kowtow.

50
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:52,360
Xiao Han ranked first in points
last round.

51
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,760
Chen Qiang was at the bottom
with zero points.

52
00:02:53,760 --> 00:02:54,880
So in this instance,

53
00:02:54,880 --> 00:02:57,120
points determine your starting class
and fate.

54
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:59,560
Hand it over. The Empress Dowager
has ordered

55
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:04,290
that such unlucky things like yellow paper
and cinnabar are forbidden in the palace.

56
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:07,160
Eunuch, it's just an ordinary
peace amulet.

57
00:03:07,160 --> 00:03:08,360
There's no need for this.

58
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:10,160
Imperial Physician Xiao,
you are a smart man.

59
00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:11,760
The late emperor just passed away,

60
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:13,120
and the little prince is still young.

61
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:14,320
In this deep palace,

62
00:03:14,320 --> 00:03:16,480
the Empress Dowager's decree
is the law of heaven.

63
00:03:16,480 --> 00:03:18,640
The wrath of heaven cannot be defied.

64
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:20,320
Leave me alone.

65
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:21,960
This stupid game...

66
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:23,960
what does it matter even if we clear it?

67
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:24,520
Don't be afraid.

68
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:26,000
I'm coming to join you.

69
00:03:33,480 --> 00:03:35,400
The Empress Dowager decrees:

70
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:38,400
Summon Imperial Physician Xiao
for an audience.

71
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:41,210
Human lives are treated like dirt.

72
00:03:41,600 --> 00:03:43,400
It seems in this man-eating palace,

73
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:46,460
the Empress Dowager is the absolute
pinnacle of power.

74
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:48,560
The Empress Dowager only summoned me.

75
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:49,440
Why are you following me?

76
00:03:49,440 --> 00:03:51,170
Hmph, don't flatter yourself.

77
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:53,920
This Empress Dowager is probably the
"pinnacle of power" the system mentioned.

78
00:03:53,920 --> 00:03:54,920
I need to keep an eye on things,

79
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:56,560
lest someone dies without knowing how

80
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:58,120
just to hog all the points.

81
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:01,120
Her Grace's bedchamber is restricted.

82
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:02,320
No men allowed.

83
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:04,120
What if I insist?

84
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:07,400
If I'm not out by the midnight bell,

85
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:09,320
do as you see fit.

86
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:10,560
Fine.

87
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:11,800
If you're not out

88
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:13,000
past midnight,

89
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:15,000
I'll level this Kunning Palace.

90
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:17,800
Remember, don't die an ugly death.

91
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:20,899
I don't want to go in
and fish out a rotten corpse.

92
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:27,800
Dr. Xiao, do you smell it?

93
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:29,440
The wind in the palace has changed.

94
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:31,840
There's a new stench of death.

95
00:04:32,159 --> 00:04:33,760
Come check on the royal heir.

96
00:04:34,159 --> 00:04:37,520
If you can't cure him, you'll end up
like that cold corpse outside.

97
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:38,640
is your end.

98
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:40,920
Since she's already at the peak of power,

99
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:42,720
why bother testing me?

100
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:44,360
Summoning me alone late at night,

101
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:45,360
what is she after?

102
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,960
Missing dominant genetic traits.

103
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:48,620
This isn't royal blood at all.

104
00:04:50,960 --> 00:04:52,640
No reaction to pain.

105
00:04:52,960 --> 00:04:55,640
He's been fed nerve-paralyzing drugs
for a long time.

106
00:04:55,640 --> 00:04:58,570
This child is a scapegoat
who could die at any moment.

107
00:04:59,320 --> 00:05:01,380
To Your Grace, the royal heir is fine.

108
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:02,600
Dr. Xiao,

109
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:04,200
wait for me a moment.

110
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:13,360
Lowly slave,

111
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:15,360
worse than a dog.

112
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:18,000
How dare you slack off
when told to scrub the chamber pots?

113
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,600
I think you have a death wish.

114
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:25,920
Trash. Slack off again
and you'll be thrown into the mass grave.

115
00:05:27,600 --> 00:05:30,760
I will climb up
and trample all of you under my feet.

116
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:40,400
Lin Xiaofei, are you blind?

117
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:42,560
Can't you see your boss suffering here?

118
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:44,560
Hurry up and scrub these pots for me.

119
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:49,520
Sister Lin, it smells awful. Let's go.

120
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:51,960
You've got some nerve, haven't you?

121
00:05:51,960 --> 00:05:53,120
How dare you talk back to me?

122
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:54,600
Believe it or not, once we clear this
and return to the company,

123
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:55,960
I'll fire you immediately.

124
00:05:55,960 --> 00:05:58,440
I'll make sure you can never work
in this industry again.

125
00:05:58,440 --> 00:06:00,720
Mr. Chen, this isn't the company.

126
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,360
If you still can't face reality,

127
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,760
scrub the pots yourself.

128
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:04,960
Qiqi, let's go.

129
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:06,040
Hurry.

130
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:06,720
Bitch.

131
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:08,160
Just you wait.

132
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:09,760
Peak of power, huh?

133
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:11,120
As long as I kill the Empress Dowager,

134
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:12,850
the clearance points are mine.

135
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:14,160
When we get to the next instance,

136
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:15,360
I'll be the rules.

137
00:06:15,440 --> 00:06:17,360
I'll trample you all to death, one by one.
